<title>HONG KONG: Trading in Dong-Jun Holdings suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Dong-Jun Holdings suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Dong-Jun (Holdings) Ltd was suspended on Thursday afternoon at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.</p>
</text>
